  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Order of pronouns",
   "texto": [
    "In these combinations, **me / te / nous / vous** goes before **le / la / les**: **Tu me le prêtes ?** (can I borrow it?).",
    "With **lui / leur**, the order is **le / la / les + lui / leur**: **Je le lui donne** (I give it to you)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Other combined pronouns",
   "texto": [
    "**Y** and **en** also combine: **Je t'y attends** (I wait for you there), **Je lui en parle** (I'm talking about it).",
    "In the affirmative imperative, the pronouns go after the verb and together with scripts: **Donne-le-moi** (give it to me)."
   ]
  },
